<p className="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 my-2">The Booking Options system manages how attendees register for your conference through a pricing matrix that combines <strong>booking periods</strong> (columns) and <strong>booking options</strong> (rows). This flexible system allows you to create time-based pricing (early bird, regular, late) for different attendance types (full conference, day passes, tutorials).</p>
