<p className="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 my-2">Discount Codes enable you to offer price reductions to specific attendees, groups, or during promotional periods. The system supports both <strong>individual codes</strong> (manually created) and <strong>bulk generation</strong> (automatically created from lists of people like sponsors, speakers, or committee members).</p>
