<ul className="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 my-4">
<li className="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Large datasets (50k+ rows) may take time</li>
<li className="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Wait up to 60 seconds</li>
<li className="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">If timeout persists, contact support to run manual export</li>
<li className="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Consider filtering data before export</li>
</ul>
